<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Prasidha says 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Prasidha says 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SURABAYA, Indonesia 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     30.7   vs   26.7</p>
<p>    Net sales			     740.8   vs  752.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     51.4   vs   55.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 37.4   vs   34.9</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT Prasidha Aneka Niaga is a trading company.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
